   "seed": 674013778,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1965589125,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "text": "- Hosting: Static Web Apps Free  ->  one App Service app (website + API, .NET 10).\n- Access: public URL  ->  private endpoint only, private DNS, Conditional Access.\n- Database: connection string  ->  keys off; app and worker use managed identities.\n- Password and TAP mail: ACS  ->  Graph sendMail from one shared mailbox, encrypted by Purview.\n- Deploys and admin tools: Cloud Shell with a key  ->  in-VNet build agent with Entra sign-in.\n- Logs: console  ->  Application Insights and Log Analytics.\n- Same: the workflow, the approvals, the agent's gated writes, tenant separation, the data model.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "- Hosting: Static Web Apps Free  ->  one App Service app (website + API, .NET 10).\n- Access: public URL  ->  private endpoint only, private DNS, Conditional Access.\n- Database: connection string  ->  keys off; app and worker use managed identities.\n- Password and TAP mail: ACS  ->  Graph sendMail from one shared mailbox, encrypted by Purview.\n- Deploys and admin tools: Cloud Shell with a key  ->  in-VNet build agent with Entra sign-in.\n- Logs: console  ->  Application Insights and Log Analytics.\n- Same: the workflow, the approvals, the agent's gated writes, tenant separation, the data model.",
